fs.description:
Filesystem URI string or configuration object. If None, use agent default FS.

Supports:
- URI strings: "file:///", "s3://bucket", "github://org/repo"
- Full configs: {"type": "github", "org": "...", "repo": "..."}
- Composed filesystems: {"type": "union", "filesystems": {...}}

